  "question": "设 $F(x,y)=\\frac{f(y-x)}{2x}$ ， $F(1,y)=\\frac{y^{2}}{2}-y+5,\\quad x_{0}>0,\\quad x_{1}=F(x_{0},2x_{0}),\\cdots,x_{n+1}=F(x_{n},2x_{n})$ ， $(n=1,2,\\cdots)$ 。证明 $\\lim_{n\\to\\infty}x_{n}$ 存在，并求该极限。",
  "answer": "$\\lim_{n\\to \\infty}x_n = 3.$",
  "ref_source": "textbook:puheping_math_contest_v2",
  "techniques": [
    "递推数列",
    "极限计算"
  ],
  "solution": {
    "steps": [
      {
        "id": "s1",
        "text": "分析 求出 $F(x, y)$ 的表达式就知道了数列 $x_{n}$ 的递推关系式，再用单调有界原理求极限."
      },
      {
        "id": "s2",
        "text": "令 $x = 1, \\frac{f(y - 1)}{2} = F(1, y) = \\frac{y^2}{2} - y + 5,$ 即有"
      },
      {
        "id": "s3",
        "text": "f (y - 1) = y ^ {2} - 2 y + 1 0 = (y - 1) ^ {2} + 9."
      },
      {
        "id": "s4",
        "text": "从而"
      },
      {
        "id": "s5",
        "text": "f (y - x) = (y - x) ^ {2} + 9, \\quad F (x, y) = \\frac {(y - x) ^ {2} + 9}{2 x}."
      },
      {
        "id": "s6",
        "text": "则"
      },
      {
        "id": "s7",
        "text": "x _ {1} = \\frac {(2 x _ {0} - x _ {0}) ^ {2} + 9}{2 x _ {0}} = \\frac {x _ {0} ^ {2} + 9}{2 x _ {0}},"
      }
    ],
    "final_answer": "$\\lim_{n\\to \\infty}x_n = 3.$",
    "techniques_used": [
      "递推数列",
      "极限计算"
    ]
  },
